# a format 23 project, from before rayon's Ops page (format 24: TP_ROPS .. TP_RFB after TP_KSUB), and its presets
# (format 13: a user preset without the Ops page): saved by that build, for the migration's test
# (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 3 knit with the Mod page set (sync, sweep 24, cross 40, the low square), saved
# as user preset U1; track 4 rayon (its fall 30).
# Run by a format 23 build (b177061): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v23.xy
wait 300
bpm 105
param 3 engine knit
param 3 x1 71
param 3 x2 90
param 3 ksync 1
param 3 ksweep 24
param 3 kcross 40
param 3 ksub 2
wait 40
usersave 3 1
param 4 engine 1
param 4 x1 30
wait 40
projsave 1 v23_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v23.bin
